{"name":"Roland-Garros","hex":"#bb5522","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"French Open","blocks":[{"text":"The French Open, also known as Roland-Garros, is a tennis tournament organized by the French Tennis Federation annually at Stade Roland Garros in Paris, France. It is chronologically the second of the four Grand Slam tennis events every year, held after the Australian Open and before Wimbledon and the US Open. It was established in 1891, but it did not become a Grand Slam level event until 1925."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1d/Logo_Roland-Garros.svg/330px-Logo_Roland-Garros.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Open"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Court_Philippe_Chatrier_May_30th_2013.jpg/500px-Court_Philippe_Chatrier_May_30th_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Court_Philippe_Chatrier_May_30th_2013.jpg/1280px-Court_Philippe_Chatrier_May_30th_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Court_Philippe_Chatrier_May_30th_2013.jpg/500px-Court_Philippe_Chatrier_May_30th_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A match between Roger Federer and Julien Benneteau on Court Philippe Chatrier during the 2013 French Open","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACourt_Philippe_Chatrier_May_30th_2013.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Court_Philippe_Chatrier_2023_cropped.jpg/500px-Court_Philippe_Chatrier_2023_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Court_Philippe_Chatrier_2023_cropped.j